  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO Memory of the World Initiative to Safeguard Documentary Heritag</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to safeguard the world&apos;s documentary heritage affected/threatened by natural disasters or human-made hazards in line with the Memory of the World (MoW) Programme and the 2015 UNESCO Recommendation concerning the Preservation of, and Access to, Documentary Heritage including in Digital Form, by providing financial support to local, regional, and international projects based on a global call for proposals, as well as by generating a synergy with and thus complementing the ongoing JFIT project on &quot;Consolidating the gains in policy development and capacity-building for the preservation and accessibility of documentary heritage&quot;(2022-2025).</narrative>
  </description>
